# Normalize line endings.
#
# Without this, checking out on Windows rewrites every file to CRLF and git then
# reports the entire repo as modified -- a diff that touches every line of every
# file, destroying blame history and making any PR unreviewable.
#
# text=auto eol=lf: store LF in the repo, check out LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these
*.bin  binary
*.pt   binary
*.png  binary
*.ipynb text eol=lf
